These files hold the weights of timm/PE-Core-B-16 on Hugging Face (revision 0038414f), unchanged.
whenframe changed how the image tower is written, not what it computes: scripts/pe_core.py writes
the rotary position embedding of its attention with the same arithmetic in fewer memory operations,
exports the tower to ONNX, fixes it to one image of 224 pixels at a time and saves it for OpenVINO
(pe-core-b16-vision.xml and pe-core-b16-vision.bin).
